## 📋 8. Table Formatting Rules

### 8.1 No Icons in Table Headers
- **Do NOT** place emoji or decorative icons inside `<th>` or markdown table header cells (e.g., `🌟 Set 1`, `⚡ Set 2`).
- Table headers should contain plain descriptive text only. Icons in headers add visual noise without conveying information.
- ✅ Correct: `Set 1 (Bosch Touch)` | ❌ Incorrect: `🌟 Set 1 (Bosch Touch)`
- This applies to both HTML `<table>` headers and markdown pipe-table headers across all documents in the project.

