## 🎨 9. Color Coordination & Style Matching Guardrails

When analyzing search results, proposing alternatives, or compiling appliance/material lists:
- **Rule**: You must check if color matching is critical for the query or context.
- **For Appliances**: Always verify that the proposed model color exactly matches the rest of the set (e.g., all-black glass for Set 2, no steel/chrome borders).
- **For Materials/Furniture**: Always verify that the proposed floor, wall, facade, ceiling, or lighting material aligns with the unified apartment-wide color scheme and style defined in [Design_Concept.md](file:///c:/Users/User/Documents/price-scrapper/00_Master/Design_Concept.md).
- **Search Verification**: Do not recommend an alternative just because it matches specs/price; it must pass the color/aesthetic requirement first.
